          "Step 3: Total $= 10x = 10(40/3) = 400/3$. Re-evaluating: If C is $40 more than A, $5x-2x=40$, $3x=40$. Total $10x = 400/3$. If the question meant $60 more, total is 200."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}